@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam DefaultFontName Arial

actor "Văn thư" as Admin
participant "Giao diện (Web)" as UI
participant "E-Office Service" as OfficeSvc
participant "Storage (S3/MinIO)" as Storage
database "Cơ sở dữ liệu" as DB

Admin -> UI : Điền thông tin, Upload File & Submit
activate UI

UI -> OfficeSvc : POST /api/v1/documents/publish (FormData)
activate OfficeSvc

OfficeSvc -> Storage : Gửi File Binary để lưu trữ
activate Storage
Storage --> OfficeSvc : Trả về File_URL an toàn
deactivate Storage

OfficeSvc -> DB : Truy vấn cấu hình Số tự tăng (Sequence)
activate DB
DB --> OfficeSvc : Current_Number
deactivate DB

OfficeSvc -> OfficeSvc : Sinh Mã Công Văn (Generated_ID)

OfficeSvc -> DB : INSERT bản ghi Document (Status: PUBLISHED)
activate DB
DB --> OfficeSvc : Success
deactivate DB

OfficeSvc -> DB : Ghi Log Ban hành (Audit)
OfficeSvc -> DB : INSERT Queue gửi Notification cho Danh sách nhận
OfficeSvc --> UI : 201 Created + Document_ID

UI --> Admin : Hiển thị màn hình "Ban hành thành công"
deactivate OfficeSvc
deactivate UI
@enduml